---
import Policy from '../layouts/Policy.astro';
import { formatAddressLines, site } from '../site.config';
---

<Policy title="Privacy policy" description="What information Fox Fobz collects, how it's used, and your choices.">
  <p>
    This policy explains what {site.legalName} (“Fox Fobz”, “we”) collects when you visit foxfobz.com or buy from us, and
    what we do with it. We don’t sell your personal information.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <h3>When you buy a kit</h3>
  <p>
    Your name, email address, phone number, shipping address, the vehicle year and body style you select, and what you
    ordered. Payment is handled by Stripe on its own checkout page — we never see or store your full card number.
  </p>
  <h3>When you join our email list</h3>
  <p>Your email address and when you signed up.</p>
  <h3>When you browse the site</h3>
  <p>
    We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which counts page views without cookies and without tracking you across sites. Our
    spam check (Cloudflare Turnstile) and the install video (YouTube, loaded only when you press play) may process
    technical data such as your IP address and browser details.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To process payment, ship your order, and send your receipt and tracking</li>
    <li>To answer support, warranty and return requests</li>
    <li>
      To send product updates and news, only if you joined our list or opted in at checkout. Every marketing email will
      include a way to unsubscribe, and you can always ask us to remove you.
    </li>
    <li>To prevent fraud and spam, and to meet legal and tax obligations</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>Only the service providers we need to run the store:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Stripe</strong> — payments, receipts and sales tax</li>
    <li><strong>Pirate Ship</strong> and the shipping carrier (USPS or UPS) — shipping labels and tracking emails</li>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — website hosting, data storage, analytics and spam protection</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We may also disclose information if required by law.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    Order records are kept as long as needed for warranty support and tax and accounting requirements. Email list entries
    are kept until you unsubscribe or ask us to delete them.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask to see, correct or delete your personal information, or to be removed from our email list, by emailing
    <a href={`mailto:${site.supportEmail}`}>{site.supportEmail}</a>. Depending on where you live, you may have additional
    rights under state privacy laws; we’ll honor those requests as the law requires.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>Our site isn’t directed to children under 13, and we don’t knowingly collect their information.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If we change this policy, we’ll update the date at the top of this page.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <address>
    {formatAddressLines().map((line) => <>{line}<br /></>)}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.supportEmail}`}>{site.supportEmail}</a>
  </address>
</Policy>
